      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s to keep the class hierarchy separate for `SharedTextureMemoryContents` and `SharedBufferMemoryContents` as we don\u0027t want to add texture-specific stuff to buffers in the future and vice-versa.\n\nI\u0027ll add a type alias instead for now.",
