      "writtenOn": "2026-02-24T12:59:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only the AHB with YCbCr formats will end up being textures with format `OpaqueYCbCrAndroid`. An RGBA8 AHB will be a `RGBA8Unorm` texture that doesn\u0027t use this code path at all. See [`FormatFromAHardwareBufferFormat`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/AHBFunctions.cpp;drc\u003da410d24e93ef7dc026984f6486d11ca08e413a71;l\u003d40).",
